  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Electronic configuration of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Rb</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>Kr</mi></mfenced><mn>5</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>1</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Rb</mi></math> is alkali metal with valence electron in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> subshell. Hence, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Rb</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>Kr</mi><mo>]</mo><mn>5</mn><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>1</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence, the answer is option A,</p>",
    "image": null
  },
